{"body_markdown":"## 背景\n\n研究要比较求和顺序对抵消输入的影响。\n\n## 经过\n\n先用顺序求和处理三项抵消输入，单位增量完全丢失；随后加入 Kahan 补偿作对照，补偿后仍丢失，说明补偿不能覆盖所有抵消情形。\n\n## 结论与未决\n\n在这组三项输入上，顺序与补偿都未保住单位增量；更多排列需要后续实验。依据：[[@第一轮原始结果:单位增量顺序与抵消|第一轮原始结果]]；精确基准见 [[@浮点求和方法:精确基准、递推与适用条件#reference|精确基准定义]]。","change_reason":"记录第一轮实际经过","content_hash":"e929447c8ec56e8dd44889354b7e1f2d777f2a9c0e3983a7529bd1a6194ae95b","created_at":"2026-10-14T20:05:42.690325Z","created_by":{"id":"compat-fixture","kind":"ai"},"discovery":"workspace_summary","handle":"从单位增量丢失到补偿比较的第一轮经过","keywords":["浮点求和","Kahan"],"kind":"narrative","level":"L2","links":[{"ref":{"locator":"record","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"5065b67570aa0e33b038c58f87fbb9c32dba84502e63303d24b33eead9a7ef9e","target_id":"MEM-7b98f79a-da6f-5e55-b1dd-85f36ccfd11a","target_kind":"record"},"status":"resolved","text":"@第一轮原始结果:单位增量顺序与抵消"},{"ref":{"locator":"block:reference","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"ba12342c6ca8afa0a1760dc517fd7bff2d1b60c7f082ee9113e419572834df51","target_id":"MEM-4acc73bb-59c7-560d-9415-fd42e9dcaa2d","target_kind":"record"},"status":"resolved","text":"@浮点求和方法:精确基准、递推与适用条件#reference"},{"ref":null,"status":"unresolved_concept","text":"补偿求和"},{"ref":null,"status":"unresolved_concept","text":"大数抵消"}],"owner_id":"RES-FLOATING-POINT-SUMMATION","payload":{"claims":[{"claim_id":"CLM-EXAMPLE-NARR-1","evidence_refs":[{"locator":"全文","note":"第三轮输出：补偿后仍为 1e16","relation":"supports","revision":null,"sha256":"cdb1f9e4f0580d5baaea4a09416f75801e6c5d01eab96c601ded00a28e31134d","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-R01","target_kind":"file"}],"kind":"fact","relation":{"participants":[{"role":"method","value":"[[补偿求和|Kahan 补偿]]"},{"role":"case","value":"[[大数抵消]]"}],"predicate":"fails_on"},"scope":"三项构造的 binary64 抵消输入","statement":"在三项抵消输入上 Kahan 补偿未能保住单位增量"}],"experience_refs":[],"limitations":["只有三项构造输入"],"missing_refs":[],"process_refs":[],"question":"求和顺序与补偿能否保住被大数抵消的单位增量","stages":[{"action":"顺序求和","evidence_refs":[{"locator":"全文","relation":"suppo